# Trivy findings accepted deliberately (security.yml). Each line expires on its `exp:` date;
# after that the job fails again and it has to be reviewed again.
#
# Trivy checks the production images (api/Dockerfile and web/Dockerfile), which don't include pip
# or npm. Reviewed: 2026-10-12.

# Caddy 2.11.9 (web/Dockerfile) ships golang.org/x/net 0.60.0; 0.62.0 fixes a denial of service
# in its HTML parser. In Caddy that parser is reached through the `templates` directive, which
# the Caddyfile doesn't use. No Caddy image ships x/net 0.62 yet; the 2.11-alpine tag picks it up
# when rebuilt. Reviewed: 2026-11-11.
CVE-2026-78661 exp:2026-11-25

# Go 1.26.8 crypto/x509 in the same Caddy binary: fixed in Go 1.26.10, which no Caddy 2.11 image
# ships yet. Caddy only verifies certificate chains as a client when it talks to the ACME CA.
CVE-2026-111943 exp:2026-11-24
